OL,3,ASpain's rail authorities face European
OL,4,Afraud probe after Urda rail disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FEuropean Union prosecutors have begun
OL,7,Finvestigating the possible misuse of EU
OL,8,Ffunds meant for upgrading the Spanish
OL,9,Frailway line where a train crash killed
OL,10,F69 people last week.
OL,12,FProsecutors backed by a special unit of
OL,13,FSpain's Guardia Civil security force
OL,14,Fsaid they were conducting the inquiry
OL,15,Fat the offices of Adif rail
OL,16,Finfrastructure authority and rail
OL,17,Fsafety agency AESF.
OL,19,FThe 28 October accident on the
OL,20,FMadrid-Seville high-speed line was one
OL,21,Fof the worst railway disasters in
OL,22,FEurope this century.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
