OL,3,ASpain's rail authorities face European
OL,4,Afraud probe after Urda rail disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the second EU fraud inquiry
OL,7,Fopened into Spain's railways this year,
OL,8,Fafter 46 people were killed on the same
OL,9,Fline at Adamuz in January.
